id: pm-zvy31w
title: Isolate CodSpeed dependency setup from unrelated Chrome APT index failures
description: "The benchmark runner inherits an unused Chrome APT source. PR 1225 run 34384419100 attempts 1 and 2 fail before benchmarks because its Packages.gz hash differs from the signed index. Preserve the source files but disable them in this disposable benchmark runner, retaining signature verification for Ubuntu dependencies."
