acceptance_criteria: Only unused Chrome sources disabled; Ubuntu sources and verification intact; present and absent fixtures plus workflow checks pass; hosted benchmarks execute and upload.
parent: pm-yh6t
severity: medium
resolution: CodSpeed setup preserves but disables only unused Chrome APT source files on its disposable runner before installing signed Ubuntu instrument dependencies.
expected_result: Unrelated Chrome index outages do not prevent benchmark dependency installation; package verification and other sources remain intact.
actual_result: "Actual-step filesystem fixtures, pinned actionlint, ShellCheck and all 14 workflow contract tests passed. Original attempts reproduced the hash refusal; the new hosted benchmark run is pending."
